{
  "_comment": [
    "Model registry. Fields:",
    "  path             HF repo id, or the provider's model id for API models",
    "  type             hf | openai | gemini | deepseek",
    "  chat_template    key into core/chat_templates.TEMPLATES (null for base models)",
    "  tl_support       has a TransformerLens conversion (required for backend='tlens')",
    "  default_backend  backend used when --backend is not passed",
    "  n_params_b       parameter count in billions; above 30 the model is",
    "                   automatically sharded across every allocated GPU",
    "  masked           masked LM rather than autoregressive",
    "  moe              sparse mixture-of-experts; the dense mlp_pre/mlp_post",
    "                   hook sites do not exist on these models",
    "  reasoning        emits a chain-of-thought trace",
    "  api_logit_support  provider exposes token logprobs"
  ],

