  "_gemma4_comment": [
    "Gemma 4 needs transformers>=5.5 and so runs in its own conda env",
    "(model_environments/gemma4_env.yml), not world_model_env. Consequences:",
    "  tl_support is false throughout   TransformerLens ships no Gemma-4",
    "                                   conversion; interp runs on backend=hf.",
    "  chat_template is 'gemma4'        Gemma 4 replaced <start_of_turn> with",
    "                                   <|turn>...<turn|>; the 'gemma' template",
    "                                   is wrong for these models.",
    "  moe                              26B-A4B is sparse (128 experts, top-8).",
    "                                   Its layers keep a dense mlp alongside the",
    "                                   routed experts and sum the two, so the",
    "                                   mlp_* hooks would capture only the dense",
    "                                   half; core/backends/hf.py rejects them.",
    "                                   attn_head/attn_out/resid_post are fine.",
    "The *-assistant checkpoints in the collection are speculative-decoding",
    "drafts, not standalone models, so they are deliberately omitted."
  ],
